{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/5c69812c0bf39df07f7b61db7900430f.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/34f9e707dc472ed0aeb2f79f2ff2e4a5.poster.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/34f9e707dc472ed0aeb2f79f2ff2e4a5.webm?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/34f9e707dc472ed0aeb2f79f2ff2e4a5.mp4?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOJITO Woody's Rescue puts you on a journey to find your best dog friend Woody, who has been kidnapped by an evil Cucumber, in a cute 3d adventure with sandbox levels, platforming challenges and exploration zones. Inspired by Super Mario 64 - Odyssey / Banjo Kazooie / Donkey Kong Country</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/27a9ae78ff11590c11b0a8f17bf3b38d.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/4b0cd76d50a541279c21111a81b625ea.poster.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/4b0cd76d50a541279c21111a81b625ea.webm?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/4b0cd76d50a541279c21111a81b625ea.mp4?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mojito joins forces with Lana! Together, they become even cuter, and Lana opens up new ways to explore, interact, and expand Mojito\u2019s moveset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/65dd10311797b078d37894f3c206a5e5.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/e6c6df99baad932d150bacfaef4240fa.poster.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/e6c6df99baad932d150bacfaef4240fa.webm?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/e6c6df99baad932d150bacfaef4240fa.mp4?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOJITO Woody's Rescue combines <strong>Open World, 3D Linear and 2.5D platformer</strong> gameplay styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/578401780f1e79ac4a34fc75c44448d3.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/b4ecb921bf67b104cb3a58da8854c52d.poster.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/b4ecb921bf67b104cb3a58da8854c52d.webm?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/b4ecb921bf67b104cb3a58da8854c52d.mp4?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on tight! Wagon levels in <i>MOJITO Woody's Rescue</i> are built for thrill-seekers and explorers alike. Rush through at top speed or ride the rails at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/4801d72672319a5f6041a59b20fca41c.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3375ad40fccf945357ed88d6b8aeae28.poster.avif?t=1769615044\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3375ad40fccf945357ed88d6b8aeae28.webm?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3375ad40fccf945357ed88d6b8aeae28.mp4?t=1769615044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not only about action and jumps, you will face multiple mental challenges and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/